                        "entry_id": "a8a200e1-c1c7-35bc-86a3-bc9a47bdf7bb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "steadily, relentlessly"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a050bc09-d230-4505-a5d1-0c82f68dcf92",
                                "sense_id": "6fe53104-cf55-3433-aa3e-f8d76edcfa5b",
                                "text": "Е́сли мы пу́стим всё э́то на самотёк, то проце́нт реа́льных и потенциа́льных алкого́ликов бу́дет неукло́нно расти́",
                                "translation": "If we let all this run its course, the percentage of actual and potential alcoholics will increase steadily",
                                "english": "If we let all this run its course, the percentage of actual and potential alcoholics will increase steadily"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b53cf2c1-d9b6-3592-bc3e-b9d75f16e5cb",
                        "entry_id": "a8a200e1-c1c7-35bc-86a3-bc9a47bdf7bb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "steadfastly"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d00d85d7-7bbe-45a6-a4b7-aca951a06895",
                                "sense_id": "b53cf2c1-d9b6-3592-bc3e-b9d75f16e5cb",
                                "text": "Саратовцы опуска́ются в турни́рной табли́це ме́дленно, но неукло́нно",
                                "translation": "The Saratov (FC) players are slowly but surely signing themselves off the league standings",
                                "english": "The Saratov (FC) players are slowly but surely signing themselves off the league standings"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
